{
  "_about": "Make scenario 6991667 in team 1579313 (org 'Just Now For Building Cleaning Services CO LLC', us2.make.com). Exported 2026-11-11. Trigger: custom webhook 3051146, which receives the Hostinger Email webhook 'Make - inbox listener (CRM + alerts)' (event message.received) for customer.care@justnow.life. No secrets in this file: the webhook URL and the Hostinger signing secret are not stored here.",
